(A/'STATUS.md').write_text(f'STATE: Stage17 saved: two prescribed narrow resets paid SAME original rate4 for all width/padding/adaptive wide histories; reserve>3/256; {n} exact checks/{result["histories"]} histories PASS; one-reset source HOLDS; FEI OPEN, new review pending.\nNEXT: A094/A086 review; expose remaining wide coordinate after BOTH resets, preserving booked p1+p2, all old releases and complementary full terminal; pay specified reset from SAME unused original quota.\n',encoding='utf-8')
